{"4410890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oh Ship!", "steam_appid": 4410890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh Ship!</strong> is a <strong>1–4 player co-op space survival game</strong> where you and your crew are responsible for keeping your ship functioning while everything around you is actively trying to destroy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage abandoned wrecks for scrap, repair damaged modules, upgrade your ship's systems for a better chance of survival, and fight off enemy attackers. Space is dangerous and unforgiving—and it will test both your ability and your crew's teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things <i>will</i> go wrong. Systems will fail at the worst possible moment. Someone will forget to fix something important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/b5c4dae461c80185d64f9f7482630811.avif?t=1786052640\" width=616 height=75 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/461e65b3ecdaad27f47b93436d4b9f00.poster.avif?t=1786052640\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/461e65b3ecdaad27f47b93436d4b9f00.webm?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/461e65b3ecdaad27f47b93436d4b9f00.mp4?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintaining The Ship</strong> <br>Maintain critical ship systems to ensure a safe voyage and a successful mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore a problem too long, and small issues quickly become catastrophic ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/ea52b9330fd305ed090e55cf78629892.avif?t=1786052640\" width=616 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/626562522a8f9e29578286105492c7e8.poster.avif?t=1786052640\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/626562522a8f9e29578286105492c7e8.webm?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/626562522a8f9e29578286105492c7e8.mp4?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Ship Wrecks</strong> <br>Explore procedurally generated ship wrecks full of valuable scrap and unpredictable dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every wreck is different, keeping every salvage run fresh and tense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/3fe689757587dd082569db7a0fc3302c.avif?t=1786052640\" width=616 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/910bbf25a443ec293df46889cab0709e.poster.avif?t=1786052640\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/910bbf25a443ec293df46889cab0709e.webm?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/910bbf25a443ec293df46889cab0709e.mp4?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Everything</strong> <br>Use your hard-earned scrap to purchase upgrades for both your crew and your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve weapons, defenses, and systems to handle escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/67f2c9ebd9715ba4cf7bea2b076ac006.avif?t=1786052640\" width=616 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/9af51e37205c923bc50468dc00bb37d3.poster.avif?t=1786052640\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/9af51e37205c923bc50468dc00bb37d3.webm?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/9af51e37205c923bc50468dc00bb37d3.mp4?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Threats</strong> <strong>&amp;</strong> <strong>Environmental Hazards</strong> <br>Encounters with hostile ships will force your crew to defend the hull, manage ship systems, and survive combat under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if that wasn't enough, deadly space hazards and unforgiving wreck security systems are determined on making sure you return to your ship in several pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/16a8398d79968873315c79fe52abe15f.avif?t=1786052640\" width=616 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/8bfc1d96e2a5e866c9d5b9890f69641f.poster.avif?t=1786052640\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/8bfc1d96e2a5e866c9d5b9890f69641f.webm?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/8bfc1d96e2a5e866c9d5b9890f69641f.mp4?t=1786052640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op for 1–4 Players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the mission alone, or with your friends. It's your call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, shout instructions, blame each other, and somehow make it out alive. Or don’t.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh Ship!</strong> is a <strong>1–4 player co-op space survival game</strong> where you and your crew are responsible for keeping your ship functioning while everything around you is actively trying to destroy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage abandoned wrecks for scrap, repair damaged modules, upgrade your ship's systems for a better chance of survival, and fight off enemy attackers. Space is dangerous and unforgiving—and it will test both your ability and your crew's teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things <i>will</i> go wrong. Systems will fail at the worst possible moment. Someone will forget to fix something important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410890/extras/b5c4dae461c80185d64f9f7482630811.avif?t=1786052640\" width=616 height=75 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"